RangeAccrualNote::mint
├── given valid NoteId and liquidity amount
│   ├── when tokenId is new (first mint for this NoteId)
│   │   ├── it snapshots entryGrowthInside from the accumulator source.
│   │   ├── it snapshots entryGlobalGrowth from the accumulator source.
│   │   ├── it sets totalLiquidity to the minted amount.
│   │   ├── it mints ERC-1155 tokens to the recipient.
│   │   └── it validates the NoteId (tickLower < tickUpper, notionalRatio > 0).
│   └── when tokenId already exists (subsequent mint, same epoch+range)
│       ├── it does NOT re-snapshot (preserves original entry values).
│       ├── it increments totalLiquidity additively.
│       └── it mints additional ERC-1155 tokens to the recipient.
├── given NoteId with tickLower >= tickUpper
│   └── it reverts with InvalidRange.
├── given NoteId with notionalRatio == 0
│   └── it reverts with InvalidNotionalRatio.
└── given zero liquidity amount
    └── it reverts.
